    "directions": [
      "For spice powder heat pan medium flame and dry all the ingredients till nice fragrant. Turn off the flame and let it cool down. Grind them into coarse powder.",
      "Now heat oil in pan on medium flame. add asafoetida, onion seeds, ginger, garlic and saute till fragrant.",
      "Now add baby potatoes and toss on high flame for few minutes.",
      "Lower the flame and add red chili powder, anardana powder, chaat masala powder, salt and 2 tsp of the prepared masala.",
      "Add Â¼ cup water and toss so that each potato is well coated with masala. Turn off the flame.",
      "Top it off with fresh coriander and white sesame seeds."
